</div></nav>

<header class="hero" id="top">
<!-- LB-3D-HERO -->
  <canvas id="heroCanvas" aria-hidden="true"></canvas>
  <div class="hero-shade"></div>
  <div class="hero-in">
    <div class="hero-copy">
    <p class="hero-kicker">Detailing studio — West Gosford, Central Coast</p>
    <h1>Bring back the<br><span class="acc">shine</span><br>&mdash; then protect it.<br><span class="thin">Car detailing &middot; Paint correction &middot; Graphene protection</span></h1>
    <p class="hero-sub">Full interior and exterior details, machine paint correction and long-life graphene protection &mdash; cars, 4WDs, boats and motorhomes, done in the West Gosford workshop by people who care about the reflections.</p>
    <div class="hero-cta">
      <a class="btn btn-primary" href="#quote">Get a free quote</a>
      <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="tel:+61405733769">Call 0405 733 769</a>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-strip">
      <p><strong><strong>Graphene protection</strong></strong>long-life paint seal</p>
      <p><strong><strong>Workshop lighting</strong></strong>we check the finish with you</p>
      <p><strong><strong>West Gosford</strong></strong>Central Coast studio</p>
    </div>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-visual">
      <figure>
        <span class="hero-tag mono">Graphene-coated finish</span>
        <img src="assets/work.jpg" alt="Allards Auto Detailing — Graphene-coated finish">
        <span class="hv-motif" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      </figure>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>



<section id="services"><div class="wrap">
  <div class="sec-head"><span class="sec-idx">01</span><div><h2 class="sec-title">Detailing that shows up in the reflections.</h2><p class="lead">From a maintenance wash through to a full graphene-protected detail &mdash; the right package for the finish you are chasing.</p></div></div>
  <div class="svc-grid"><div class="svc-row rv"><span class="svc-n">01</span><div class="svc-body"><h3>Graphene protection</h3><p>The signature package &mdash; paint sealed with a long-life graphene coating that shrugs off water, grime and UV.</p></div><span class="svc-arrow">&#8599;</span></div><div class="svc-row rv"><span class="svc-n">02</span><div class="svc-body"><h3>Full interior &amp; exterior detail</h3><p>Paint decontaminated and polished, interior detailed to the seams &mdash; inside and out in one booking.</p></div><span class="svc-arrow">&#8599;</span></div><div class="svc-row rv"><span class="svc-n">03</span><div class="svc-body"><h3>Paint enhancement &amp; correction</h3><p>Swirls, haze and light defects machine-polished back so reflections run flat and clean.</p></div><span class="svc-arrow">&#8599;</span></div><div class="svc-row rv"><span class="svc-n">04</span><div class="svc-body"><h3>Exterior wash &amp; decontamination</h3><p>Foam wash, clay decontamination and a hand finish that leaves paint glassy to the touch.</p></div><span class="svc-arrow">&#8599;</span></div><div class="svc-row rv"><span class="svc-n">05</span><div class="svc-body"><h3>Interior detailing</h3><p>Seats, carpets, dash and trim vacuumed, shampooed and dressed &mdash; the parts you live in every day.</p></div><span class="svc-arrow">&#8599;</span></div><div class="svc-row rv"><span class="svc-n">06</span><div class="svc-body"><h3>Boats &amp; motorhomes</h3><p>Gelcoat cut and polish, hull wash-downs and protection for boats, caravans and motorhomes.</p></div><span class="svc-arrow">&#8599;</span></div></div>
</div></section>

<section class="band" id="process"><div class="wrap">
  <div class="sec-head"><span class="sec-idx">02</span><div><h2 class="sec-title">Booked in, detailed, protected.</h2></div></div>
  <div class="steps"><div class="step rv"><span class="step-n">01</span><div><h3>Book it in</h3><p>Call or send the form &mdash; tell us the vehicle and what you are chasing.</p></div></div><div class="step rv"><span class="step-n">02</span><div><h3>Assess &amp; quote</h3><p>We look over the paint and interior and match the right package.</p></div></div><div class="step rv"><span class="step-n">03</span><div><h3>Detail day</h3><p>Wash, decontaminate, polish, protect &mdash; inside and out.</p></div></div><div class="step rv"><span class="step-n">04</span><div><h3>Handover</h3><p>We walk the vehicle with you under the lights so you can see the finish.</p></div></div></div>
</div></section>

<section id="faq"><div class="wrap faq-wrap">
  <div class="sec-head"><span class="sec-idx">03</span><div><h2 class="sec-title">Asked on every detail.</h2></div></div>
  <details class="faq rv"><summary>Do you work on boats and motorhomes too?</summary><div class="a">Yes &mdash; cars, 4WDs, boats, caravans and motorhomes all get detailed in the West Gosford workshop.</div></details><details class="faq rv"><summary>What is graphene protection?</summary><div class="a">A long-life coating that seals and protects the paint, making it easier to wash and harder for grime to take hold.</div></details><details class="faq rv"><summary>Which areas do you cover?</summary><div class="a">We are based in West Gosford on the Central Coast &mdash; drop the vehicle to us or call to discuss.</div></details><details class="faq rv"><summary>How long does a full detail take?</summary><div class="a">Depends on the vehicle and the package &mdash; we confirm the timing when you book.</div></details>
</div></section>

<section class="stat-band band" id="stats"><div class="wrap"><div class="stat rv d1"><b>5.0</b><span>Google rated</span></div><div class="stat rv d2"><b>Graphene</b><span>Paint protection</span></div><div class="stat rv d3"><b>In &amp; out</b><span>Full details</span></div><div class="stat rv d4"><b>West Gosford</b><span>Central Coast</span></div></div></section>

<section id="trust"><div class="wrap">
  <div class="sec-head"><span class="sec-idx">04</span><div><h2 class="sec-title">Why Central Coast cars come to Allards.</h2></div></div>
  <div class="trust-strip"><div class="tr-i rv d1"><div class="tr-t">&#10003;</div><div><b>Graphene protection</b><span>Long-life paint seal</span></div></div><div class="tr-i rv d2"><div class="tr-t">&#10003;</div><div><b>Paint correction</b><span>Swirl-free reflections</span></div></div><div class="tr-i rv d3"><div class="tr-t">&#10003;</div><div><b>Workshop lighting</b><span>See the finish before you go</span></div></div><div class="tr-i rv d4"><div class="tr-t">&#10003;</div><div><b>Cars, boats &amp; RVs</b><span>Not just everyday cars</span></div></div></div>
</div></section>

<section id="work"><div class="wrap">
  <div class="sec-head"><div class="sec-idx">05</div><div><h2 class="rv d1">In the bay.</h2><p class="lead rv d2">Cars, boats and motorhomes &mdash; every photo taken in our West Gosford workshop.</p></div></div>
</div>
<div class="hgal rv"><div class="track"><figure class="hg-item rv"><img src="assets/gal_1.jpg" alt="Mustang &mdash; corrected &amp; glossed — Allards Auto Detailing" loading="lazy"><figcaption><span>Mustang &mdash; corrected &amp; glossed</span><span class="mono">/01</span></figcaption></figure><figure class="hg-item rv"><img src="assets/gal_2.jpg" alt="RAM 1500 &mdash; swirl-free paint — Allards Auto Detailing" loading="lazy"><figcaption><span>RAM 1500 &mdash; swirl-free paint</span><span class="mono">/02</span></figcaption></figure><figure class="hg-item rv"><img src="assets/gal_3.jpg" alt="Motorhome &mdash; full exterior detail — Allards Auto Detailing" loading="lazy"><figcaption><span>Motorhome &mdash; full exterior detail</span><span class="mono">/03</span></figcaption></figure><figure class="hg-item rv"><img src="assets/gal_4.jpg" alt="Ski boat &mdash; gelcoat cut &amp; polish — Allards Auto Detailing" loading="lazy"><figcaption><span>Ski boat &mdash; gelcoat cut &amp; polish</span><span class="mono">/04</span></figcaption></figure><figure class="hg-item rv"><img src="assets/gal_5.jpg" alt="People-mover &mdash; multi-stage correction — Allards Auto Detailing" loading="lazy"><figcaption><span>People-mover &mdash; multi-stage correction</span><span class="mono">/05</span></figcaption></figure><figure class="hg-item rv"><img src="assets/gal_6.jpg" alt="Ski boat &mdash; hull wash &amp; protect — Allards Auto Detailing" loading="lazy"><figcaption><span>Ski boat &mdash; hull wash &amp; protect</span><span class="mono">/06</span></figcaption></figure></div></div>
